Text:
This design is about operations involving a single Fearless project; the location of this Fearless project is the Base16 in scope.
fearlessProject$allPaths is the set of the DeskPaths at Base16 or inside Base16.
fearlessProject$visiblePaths is the set of the DeskPaths of fearlessProject$allPaths where no Segment after Base16 starts with ".".
fearlessProject$fearlessPaths is the set of the paths that Fearless code sees inside Base16; fearlessProject$fearlessPaths includes the paths inside zip files.
The 'name' of a Fearless project is ProjectName when ProjectName ".fearless" is the only file at top level in that Fearless project ending with ".fearless".
fearlessProject$checkWellShaped(Base16) has no Define: fearlessProject$checkWellShaped(Base16) ends with done when the Fearless project at Base16 is 'well shaped' as tasks/FolderShapesDesign defines, and otherwise ends with the Error that a compilation of the Fearless project at Base16 gives.
fearlessProject$fearless_out is the set of the names of the files directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16.
fearlessProject$fearless_out+= "x" creates the empty file x directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16, and fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "x" deletes that file.
A modification time is a Time; 0 is before the modification time of every file.
fearlessProject$packages is the list of the PackageNames of the packages of the Fearless project at Base16 other than "base", from the lowest rank.
fearlessProject$lower(PackageName) is the set of "base" and of each PackageName' of fearlessProject$packages where the rank of PackageName' is lower than the rank of PackageName; the code of the package PackageName can use only the packages of fearlessProject$lower(PackageName).
fearlessProject$files(PackageName) is the map from each path of fearlessProject$fearlessPaths in the package PackageName to the content of the file at that path; fearlessProject$files(PackageName) holds every file of the package, also the files that are not Fearless code.
The modification time of a file inside a zip file is the modification time of that zip file.
fearlessProject$directives(PackageName) is the map directives for the package PackageName, from the rank files of every package of the Fearless project at Base16.
//later: what a package is, the rank of a package, and the map directives
fearlessProject$out(PackageName) is the Outs where the Content at "x" is the content of the file PackageName ".x" directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16, and is undefined when one of those four files is absent; fearlessProject$out("base") is the Outs of the files of "base" in the installation of Fearless.
fearlessProject$out(PackageName)= Outs writes those four files.
fearlessProject$lowerOuts(PackageName) is the map (PackageName'->fearlessProject$out(PackageName')) for each PackageName' of fearlessProject$lower(PackageName).
frontend.compile(PackageName,fearlessProject$files(PackageName),fearlessProject$directives(PackageName),fearlessProject$lowerOuts(PackageName)) has no Notation: the Fearless compiler defines it, and the result is a CompileResult.
fearlessProject$snapshot(PackageName) is dom(fearlessProject$files(PackageName)), fearlessProject$directives(PackageName), and (PackageName'->Time') for each PackageName' of fearlessProject$lower(PackageName), where Time' is the modification time of the file "jar" of fearlessProject$out(PackageName').
fearlessProject$savedSnapshot(PackageName) is the last value that fearlessProject$savedSnapshot(PackageName)= saved inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16; fearlessProject$savedSnapshot(PackageName) is undefined when no value is saved.
Compiling a package of fearlessProject$lower(PackageName) changes fearlessProject$snapshot(PackageName), so the package PackageName is compiled again, also when the "json" of that lower package did not change: the Java compiler can copy constants from the "jar" of a lower package into the "jar" of the package PackageName.

Grammar:
Time ::= [0-9]+
Content ::= any sequence of bytes
Outs ::= ("json"->Content1) ("jar"->Content2) ("html"->Content3) ("txt"->Content4)
CompileResult ::= Outs | "error(" AnyText ")"

Define fearlessProject$checkIsUpToDate(Base16):
A if "_unfinished.txt" in fearlessProject$fearless_out, error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)
B if "_compile_start.txt" not in fearlessProject$fearless_out, error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)
C if the modification time of a DeskPath in fearlessProject$visiblePaths is after the modification time of "_compile_start.txt", error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)

Define fearlessProject$previousStart(Base16):
A if "_unfinished.txt" in fearlessProject$fearless_out, return 0
B if "_compile_start.txt" not in fearlessProject$fearless_out, return 0
C action return the modification time of "_compile_start.txt"

Define fearlessProject$compile(Base16):
A action fearlessProject$previousStart(Base16) = Time
B action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= "_unfinished.txt"
C action fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "_compile_start.txt"
D action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= "_compile_start.txt"
E action wait until the clock of the file system of Base16 is after the modification time of "_compile_start.txt"
F action fearlessProject$checkWellShaped(Base16)
G fact fearlessProject$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
H action fearlessProject$compilePackage(PackageName1,Time) .. fearlessProject$compilePackage(PackageNamen,Time)
I if the modification time of a DeskPath in fearlessProject$visiblePaths is after the modification time of "_compile_start.txt", error fearlessProjectErrorFilesChangedDuringCompile(Base16)
J action fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "_unfinished.txt"

Define fearlessProject$compilePackage(PackageName,Time):
A if fearlessProject$out(PackageName) is undefined, return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
B if the modification time of a file of fearlessProject$files(PackageName) is after Time, return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
C if fearlessProject$savedSnapshot(PackageName) is undefined, return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
D if fearlessProject$savedSnapshot(PackageName) != fearlessProject$snapshot(PackageName), return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)

Define fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName):
A fact frontend.compile(PackageName,fearlessProject$files(PackageName),fearlessProject$directives(PackageName),fearlessProject$lowerOuts(PackageName)) = CompileResult
B if CompileResult = "error(" AnyText ")", error fearlessProjectErrorPackageDoesNotCompile(PackageName,AnyText)
C fact CompileResult = Outs
D action fearlessProject$out(PackageName)= Outs
E action fearlessProject$savedSnapshot(PackageName)= fearlessProject$snapshot(PackageName)
